<div style="display: grid; gap: 0.75rem">
	<norn-callout><p>Useful information to keep in mind.</p></norn-callout>
	<norn-callout @variant="tip"><p>A faster way to do the same thing.</p></norn-callout>
	<norn-callout @variant="important"><p>Something a reader needs to succeed.</p></norn-callout>
	<norn-callout @variant="warning"><p>Needs attention right away.</p></norn-callout>
	<norn-callout @variant="caution"><p>Can cause a problem you can't undo.</p></norn-callout>
